1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,950
(Sheldon:)We've already established
I'm found in the periodic table.

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,650
(Penny:)Well, it's a table, right?

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:08,190
(Penny:)I mean, why can't there
be food on it?

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:11,360
(Sheldon:)I knew she wasn't
lead car materiel.

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:14,030
(Penny:)Who elected you
Road Trip God?

6
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:16,030
(Penny:)Leonard.

7
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:18,660
(Leonard:)It was a late-night vote.

8
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:21,100
(Leonard:)We were all exhausted,

9
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,100
(Leonard:)and he was threatening
to filibuster.

10
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,270
(Leonard:)It's not technically
"Road Trip God""

11
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:26,710
(Leonard:)it's Travel Supervisor.

12
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:30,780
(Sheldon:)Although Road Trip God
does have a certain ring to it.

13
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,440
(Penny:)I don't understand
why you people

14
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:33,980
(Penny:)just let him bully
you like this.

15
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,350
(Penny:)Someone should
stand up to him.

16
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:37,320
(Penny:)What's he going to do?

17
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:42,450
(Penny:)I can't believe you let him
kick me out of the car.

18
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:45,820
(Howard:)What could we do?
He's the Travel Supervisor.

19
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:49,060
(Amy:)Don't worry, Penny.
This is a better car anyway.

20
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:51,030
(Howard:)Yeah. It's the Love Car.

21
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,700
(Penny:)Should I ask?

22
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:58,040
♪ They say we're young
and we don't know ♪

23
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:03,080
♪ We won't find out
until we grow ♪

